  "2026-07-28T04:20:05.459Z","harness:codex","Duplicate-check evidence 2026-07-28: all-status searches for blueprint lint host-owned flag collision, assertExtensionPreflight, GH-719, and GH-764 found closed author-time lint feature pm-9ect and closed runtime collision owners pm-ill9gv/pm-gnowgi, but no active owner for the static-preflight parity and malformed long-token gaps reported in GH-784. Created as the canonical open follow-up; not claimed or implemented in the current PR."
  "2026-07-28T16:27:18.802Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: one shared flag-token validator now drives blueprint lint/preflight and runtime activation, rejects host-owned and malformed long declarations with the same remediation, and preserves Commander-compatible value placeholders and legacy underscore aliases. Focused PM-linked run passed 186 tests; full coverage passed 6,468 tests at 100/100/100/100. SDK surface change is explicitly acknowledged and documented in docs/SDK.md."
  "2026-07-28T17:06:21.616Z","harness:codex","Review implementation note: author-time blueprint lint now checks short aliases with the same shared host-owned-token validator used by runtime activation."
  "2026-07-28T17:21:28.565Z","harness:codex","Final local review evidence: shared long/short author-runtime validation passes focused tests and the full 6,473-test coverage run at exact 100/100/100/100. ESLint, duplicate detection, static quality, SDK surface, token, docs, secrets, audit, and Trivy gates pass."
  "2026-07-28T17:36:29.773Z","harness:codex","Second-round Greptile evidence: author-time lint now validates definitions that declare only a short token, matching runtime activation. Dedicated --path short-only regression passes; full coverage remains exactly 100/100/100/100 across 6,473 tests."
